flowchart TD
    %% spec workflow graph — the model scripts/graph.py derives from
    %% doc state alone. Solid = data edge (ready exactly when all inputs are
    %% done). Dotted = conditional/loop edge. This is the model, not a live
    %% state: per-node states and the current frontier come from
    %% `python3 scripts/graph.py SPECS_DIR [--mermaid|--state-json]`.

    Spec["spec<br/>scaffold → draft spec.md WITH the user<br/>(human intent, never generated)"]
    Clarify["clarify<br/>grilling loop: batch the frontier of the<br/>draft's gaps into one round, recompute<br/>from the answers, repeat until empty"]

    Intent["intent<br/>/spec-idea → intent.md (optional evidence):<br/>absent → SKIPPED (legacy path),<br/>present-but-red → BLOCKED, green → spec drafted, survey proceeds"]

    Survey["survey<br/>scout → survey.md<br/>(self-checks --survey-only)"]
    Research["research<br/>researcher → research.md, out-of-band<br/>(or skip: not-applicable marker)"]

    Gate{{"research-gate<br/>orchestrator judgment:<br/>≥1 real open technical question?<br/>never auto-decided"}}

    subgraph W2["wave 2 · authoring — one message"]
        Plan["plan<br/>designer → plan.md"]
        Tech["tech<br/>designer → tech-spec.md"]
        QA["qa<br/>qa → test.md<br/>(blind to plan/tech)"]
    end

    Tasks["tasks<br/>designer → task.md<br/>(the only status holder)"]
    Verify["verify<br/>mechanical: check.py on the spec dir,<br/>exit 0 = done"]
    Approve["approve<br/>HUMAN GATE<br/>spec.md Status: approved<br/>(never auto-satisfied)"]
    Exec["execute<br/>per-task frontier: deps ticked/struck,<br/>files disjoint from wave-mates,<br/>below the fix-round cap"]
    Tick["tick-commit<br/>proof pass → ticks → C1 implementation commit<br/>→ C2 delivery record (SKIPPED-noted in non-git repos)"]
    Archive["archive<br/>specs/archive/ · dated · INDEX repointed"]

    Spec --> Intent
    Intent --> Survey
    Survey --> Plan
    Survey --> Tech
    Survey --> QA
    Plan --> Tasks
    Tech --> Tasks
    Survey --> Tasks
    Survey --> Verify
    Plan --> Verify
    Tech --> Verify
    QA --> Verify
    Tasks --> Verify
    Verify --> Approve
    Approve --> Exec
    Exec --> Tick
    Tick --> Archive

    Spec -.->|clarify loop| Clarify
    Clarify -.->|markers resolved| Spec
    Spec -.->|judgment| Gate
    Gate -.->|run| Research
    Gate -.->|resolved either way| Tech
    Exec -.->|fix rounds, cap 5 per task| Exec
    Survey -.->|converge: survey staleness<br/>→ re-survey → audit.py converge<br/>→ appended tasks| Tasks
